l;\"></div></div><div class=\"hljs-ln-code\" style=\"outline: 0px; margin-left: 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 14px; float: left; height: 22px;\"><div class=\"hljs-ln-line\" style=\"outline: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">$ git revert <span class=\"pun\" style=\"outline: 0px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 0); overflow-wrap: break-word;\">[</span><span class=\"pln\" style=\"outline: 0px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\" style=\"outline: 0px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(166, 38, 164); overflow-wrap: break-word;\">commit</span></span><span class=\"pun\" style=\"outline: 0px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 0); overflow-wrap: break-word;\">]</span><span class=\"pln\" style=\"outline: 0px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); overflow-wrap: break-word;\"></span></div></div></li><li style=\"outline: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; height: 22px;\"><div class=\"hljs-ln-numbers\" style=\"outline: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 14px; float: left; height: 22px; width: 24px; border-right: 1px solid rgb(197, 197, 197);\"><div class=\"hljs-ln-line hljs-ln-n\" data-line-number=\"28\" style=\"outline: 0px; padding-right: 8px; text-align: right; overflow-wrap: normal;\"></div></div><div class=\"hljs-ln-code\" style=\"outline: 0px; margin-left: 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 14px; float: left; height: 22px;\"><div class=\"hljs-ln-line\" style=\"outline: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"> </div></div></li><li style=\"outline: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; height: 22px;\"><div class=\"hljs-ln-numbers\" style=\"outline: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 14px; float: left; height: 22px; width: 24px; border-right: 1px solid rgb(197, 197, 197);\"><div class=\"hljs-ln-line hljs-ln-n\" data-line-number=\"29\" style=\"outline: 0px; padding-right: 8px; text-align: right; overflow-wrap: normal;\"></div></div><div class=\"hljs-ln-code\" style=\"outline: 0px; margin-left: 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 14px; float: left; height: 22px;\"><div class=\"hljs-ln-line\" style=\"outline: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span class=\"com\" style=\"outline: 0px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(136, 0, 0); overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\" style=\"outline: 0px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(160, 161, 167); font-style: italic; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"># 暂时将未提交的变化移除，稍后再移入</span></span><span class=\"pln\" style=\"outline: 0px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); overflow-wrap: break-word;\"></span></div></div></li><li style=\"outline: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; height: 22px;\"><div class=\"hljs-ln-numbers\" style=\"outline: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 14px; float: left; height: 22px; width: 24px; border-right: 1px solid rgb(197, 197, 197);\"><div class=\"hljs-ln-line hljs-ln-n\" data-line-number=\"30\" style=\"outline: 0px; padding-right: 8px; text-align: right; overflow-wrap: normal;\"></div></div><div class=\"hljs-ln-code\" style=\"outline: 0px; margin-left: 8px; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 14px; float: left; height: 22px;\"><div class=\"hljs-ln-line\" style=\"outline: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">$ git stash</div></div></li><li style=\"outline: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; height: 22px;\"><div class=\"hljs-ln-numbers\" style=\"outline: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 14px; float: left; height: 22px; width: 24px; border-right: 1px solid rgb(197, 197, 197);\"><div class=\"hljs-ln-line hljs-ln-n\" data-line-number=\"31\" style=\"outline: 0px; padding-right: 8px; text-align: right; overflow-wrap: normal;\"><br></div><div class=\"hljs-ln-line hljs-ln-n\" data-line-number=\"31\" style=\"outline: 0px; padding-right: 8px; text-align: right; overflow-wrap: normal;\"><br></div><div class=\"hljs-ln-line hljs-ln-n\" data-line-number=\"31\" style=\"outline: 0px; padding-right: 8px; text-align: right; overflow-wrap: normal;\">
 <b>撤销已经push的文件例如：</b>
首先会退版本：git reset --soft xxx(版本号)
然后将修改的保存在暂存区：git stash
提交代码：git push -f 
将代码从暂存区取出：git stash pop
提交代码：git push -f
将代码从暂存区取出：git stash pop</div><div class=\"hljs-ln-line hljs-ln-n\" data-line-number=\"31\" style=\"outline: 0px; padding-right: 8px; text-align: right; overflow-wrap: normal;\"><br></div><div class=\"hljs-ln-line hljs-ln-n\" data-line-number=\"31\" style=\"outline: 0px; padding-right: 8px; text-align: right; overflow-wrap: normal;\"><br></div><div class=\"hljs-ln-line hljs-ln-n\" data-line-number=\"31\" style=\"outline: 0px; padding-right: 8px; text-align: right; overflow-wrap: normal;\"><br></div><div class=\"hljs-ln-line hljs-ln-n\" data-line-number=\"31\" style=\"outline: 0px; padding-right: 8px; text-align: right; overflow-wrap: normal;\"><br></div><div class=\"hljs-ln-line hljs-ln-n\" data-line-number=\"31\" style=\"outline: 0px; padding-right: 8px; text-align: right; overflow-wrap: normal;\"><br></div><div class=\"hljs-ln-line hljs-ln-n\" data-line-number=\"31\" style=\"outline: 0px; padding-right: 8px; text-align: right; overflow-wrap: normal;\"><b>撤销已经push的文件：</b>

git reset --soft xxxx (版本号)</div><div class=\"hljs-ln-line hljs-ln-n\" data-line-number=\"31\" style=\"outline: 0px; padding-right: 8px; text-align: right; overflow-wrap: normal;\">
<b>然后将修改的保存在暂存区</b>：</div><div class=\"hljs-ln-line hljs-ln-n\" data-line-number=\"31\" style=\"outline: 0px; padding-right: 8px; text-align: right; overflow-wrap: normal;\">
git stash</div><div class=\"hljs-ln-line hljs-ln-n\" data-line-number=\"31\" style=\"outline: 0px; padding-right: 8px; text-align: right; overflow-wrap: normal;\">
提交代码：
